  "version": "0.3.0-alpha.2",
  "notes": "## 0.3.0-alpha.2 - 2026-03-12\n\n### Features\n\n- Improve startup and navigation performance by splitting vendor bundles and lazy-loading route modules.\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Prioritize modal Escape handling so closing dialogs no longer unintentionally closes Settings.\n- Isolate the development keyring service namespace from production data.\n\n### Refactor\n\n- Remove circular reveal and collapse transition effects from Settings animations.\n\n### Tests\n\n- Add coverage for image sync policy filtering in outbound clipboard sync tests.\n\n### Docs\n\n- Document the code-splitting approach used to resolve Vite chunk-size warnings.\n- Finalize the execution notes for the Vite chunk-size warning mitigation plan.\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.3.0-alpha.2 - 2026-03-12\n\n### 新功能\n\n- 通过拆分 vendor 包并对路由模块进行懒加载，提升启动与页面切换性能。\n\n### 修复\n\n- 优先处理模态框的 Escape 逻辑，避免关闭弹窗时误关闭设置页面。\n- 将开发环境钥匙串服务命名空间与生产数据隔离。\n\n### 重构\n\n- 移除设置页动画中的圆形展开与收起过渡效果。\n\n### 测试\n\n- 为出站剪贴板同步中的图片同步策略过滤增加测试覆盖。\n\n### 文档\n\n- 补充用于解决 Vite chunk-size 警告的代码拆分方案说明。\n- 完成 Vite chunk-size 警告治理计划的执行记录。",
